    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have experience with public procurement in Italy, France, Germany, Belgium, and EU institutions, which includes dealing with various regulatory and legal constraints. we also have expertise in GDPR, as indicated by we standard legal basis being Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest, and we data protection practices include having a DPA template version 3.2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with The client requirements, we can monitor typical legal risks such as open-source licence compliance, cross-border data flow (although since it's intra-EU operations only, typical legal risks such as open-source licence compliance, cross-border data flow shouldn't be an issue), AI Act compliance evolution, and vendor lock-in mitigation through source code escrow and open standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the contract duration of 4 years and budget of €3,000,000, we should pay close attention to we limitation of liability standard (€3,000,000) and ensure that we professional indemnity insurance (€5,000,000), cyber liability insurance (€2,000,000), and performance bond capacity (€1,500,000) are sufficient to cover potential risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It is also crucial to follow we subcontracting policy, which includes a vetting process for all subcontractors, ensuring all subcontractors are EU-established and comply with exclusion grounds checks. we known subcontractors, such as EuroCloud Solutions S.A. and LexIA GmbH, have expertise in areas that might be relevant to this project. we default IP model, which involves transferring all deliverables to the client upon final payment, aligns with the requirement for the client to own all data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we can offer source code escrow capability through Logitas (France) as an added layer of security and compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By carefully managing these aspects and adhering to we policies and standards, we can mitigate potential legal risks and ensure compliance with the client's regulatory and legal requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is €3,000,000 over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must be compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimization strategies our can propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our context, our target gross margin percentage is 28% and our minimum acceptable margin percentage is 18%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To determine the potential revenue from this contract, letour first calculate the annual budget. the annual budget is €3,000,000, so the annual budget would be approximately €750,000." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that our pricing model includes a target gross margin of 28%, if our were to achieve a target gross margin of 28%t, the potential revenue from this contract could potentially be higher than The client's global budget." ;
